    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pjk4](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pjk4) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 607.813 depth occurred on Jan 12 2025 43km E of Tuvuca. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -17.8257 longitude -178.4616. It impacted 106 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
